==Belarusian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|be|почта|poczta|počta||obsolete}}
* {{alt|be|pošta||Łacinka}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|be|zle-ort|почта}}, from {{bor|be|zlw-mpl|poczta}}, ultimately from {{der|be|it|posta}}. Compare {{cog|ru|по́чта}} and {{cog|uk|по́шта}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{be-IPA|по́шта}}
* {{audio|be|Be-пошта.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{be-noun|по́шта<sg>|adj=пашто́вы}}

# [[mail]], [[post]]
#: {{uxi|be|пасла́ць па '''по́шце'''|to mail, to post}}
#: {{uxi|be|разно́сіць '''по́шту'''|to deliver the mail}}
#: {{uxi|be|палява́я '''по́шта'''|field post}}
#: {{uxi|be|ляту́чая '''по́шта'''|airmail}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Dziadźka Anton (1892)|page=14
|Ciapier budzim rachawać tak, szto akcyzu za tabaku, harbatu, cukier, za listy, szto '''poczta''' wozić, telegrapy, my niczoha nia płacim, a płaciać tolki kupcy i pany;
|Now we are going to do calculations, assuming that we are not paying excise duties on tobacco, tea and sugar. We also assume that we are not paying anything for letters carried by the '''post''' and for telegraph services. Only merchants and landlords are making these payments.}}
#* {{quote-book|be|year=1906|title=Першае чытанне для дзетак беларусаў|author=Цйотка|location=Пецярбург|publisher=„Загляне сонцэ и ў нашэ ваконцэ“
|page=31|pageurl=https://be.wikisource.org/wiki/Старонка:Першае_чытанне_для_дзетак_беларусаў_(1906).pdf/35
|text=Хто купляе ў глаўным складзи ня менш як за поўрубель, той ня плациць за прасланне '''почтаю'''.
|t=Anyone who buys at least half a ruble's worth from the main warehouse doesn't have to pay for delivery via '''post'''.}}
#* {{quote-journal|be|year=1913|newspaper=w:be:Biełarus|issue=1|article=Nowyje marki
|page=6|pageurl=https://be.wikisource.org/wiki/Старонка:Biełarus._1913._№_1.pdf/6
|text=Ad Nowaho Hodu pa '''pocztach''' paczali pradawać nowaho rysunku pacztowyje marki s partretami asob Carskaho Domu.
|t=Starting from the New Year, '''post offices''' began selling redesigned postage stamps featuring portraits of the members of the Czar Family.}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Biełaruski chryścijanski ruch (1939)|page=155
|Na '''pošcie''' u Vaŭkavysku mnie kazali, što hazeta "Krynica" prychodziła, ale z '''pošty''' zabiraŭ jaje pasłaniec Izabelinskaha Načalnika.
|I've been told at the '''post office''' in [[w:Vaŭkavysk|Vaŭkavysk]] that the newspaper "Krynica" was arriving, but a representative of the authorities from [[w:be:Ізабелін_(Ваўкавыскі_раён)|Izabelin]] kept seizing it from the '''post office'''.}}
#* {{RQ:be:s|Вялікія чаканні (1940)|page=285
|Ад слуг я даведаўся, што Эстэла ў Парыжы і прасіў доктара паслаць ёй пісьмо з наступнаю-ж '''поштай'''.
|origtext=en:I found, on questioning the servants, that Estella was in Paris, and I got a promise from the surgeon that he would write to her by the next '''post'''.}}

